@rupic-app The test change from the same commit (`image-gallery.test.tsx`):

```diff
+vi.mock("@/components/ui/dialog", async (importOriginal) => {
+  const dialog =
+    await importOriginal<typeof import("@/components/ui/dialog")>();
+  const DialogContentWithoutRef = ({
+    ref: _ref,
+    ...props
+  }: ComponentProps<typeof dialog.DialogContent>) => (
+    <dialog.DialogContent {...props} />
+  );
+  return { ...dialog, DialogContent: DialogContentWithoutRef };
+});
```

Every test in the file runs against this `DialogContent`, which drops `ref` the way a React 18 function component would. The existing "focuses the dialog when it opens" test failed with this mock before the fix and passes after it.

