@rupic-app The fix is on this PR's branch, not on `main`: https://github.com/assistant-ui/assistant-ui/pull/8689/commits/32825f30afacb4b1c78bbd432b0af1dbf5b9b8ed

The relevant change in `mermaid-diagram.tsx`:

```diff
+const SCOPE = "[data-aui-mermaid-svg]";
+
 const adoptStyles = (root: StyleRoot, css: string) => {
   ...
     const sheet = new CSSStyleSheet();
     sheet.replaceSync(css);
+    for (const rule of sheet.cssRules) {
+      if (rule instanceof CSSStyleRule) {
+        rule.selectorText = `:where(${SCOPE}) :is(${rule.selectorText})`;
+      }
+    }
     root.adoptedStyleSheets = [...root.adoptedStyleSheets, sheet];
```

```diff
     <div
       ref={ref}
       {...props}
+      data-aui-mermaid-svg=""
       dangerouslySetInnerHTML={{ __html: constructable ? markup : svg }}
     />
```

`:where()` adds no specificity, so each rule keeps the weight it had. `mermaid-diagram.test.tsx` adds a test that an SVG outside the diagram matches none of the adopted rules.

